---
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <Meta name="Donate" description="Lunya accepts donations, so if you got some spare money, please donate!" />
        <Scripts />
        <Cursor />
    </head>

    <body>
        <canvas id="background"></canvas>
        <!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
            <Header />
            <main>
                <h1>Donate</h1>
        <p>Even if I try to run as much on free stuff as possible, it's impossible to run everything completely free of
            charge.</p>
                <p>For example, servers cost money -- regardless if it is running at your home or it's a VPS.</p>
                
                <h2>How to donate</h2>
        <p>If you do got some spare money which you don't need for anything else, you can donate to me on the following
            platforms:</p>
        <p><a href="https://ko-fi.com/LunyaUwU">Ko-fi</a> is another way to donate to me. Use this for one time payments
            -- Ko-fi takes very low cuts of your donated money.</p>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/sponsors/LunyaPet">GitHub Sponsors</a> - I set this one up recently. I don't know
            how much GitHub cuts, but you can use this to donate to me as well.</p>

                <h2>Where will your money go, if you donate?</h2>
        <p>Your money will most definitely go into my pockets. No third-parties involved. Unless I pay for something
            online.</p>
                <p>Your money will be used for example:</p>
                <ul>
            <li><strong>To support servers</strong> - My servers aren't free to run -- just like any other server -- and
                your donation will help me in running my servers for not just only me and you, but for everyone!
            </li>
            <li><strong>To motivate me in programming</strong> - If you are donating to me because I make good projects
                -- Congratulations! Your donations will help me get motivated in programming more, as I will make money
                from my work!
            </li>
            <li><strong>For other things</strong> - I am not only a programmer -- so if I will see an interesting game
                on Stema for sale, for example, I will buy it and maybe make a video on it! And I don't know... Maybe
                I'll spend it on HRT or something.
            </li>
                </ul>

                <h2>What do I host?</h2>
        <p>For a list of what I host, I made a dedicated page for this content: <a href="/services">Services</a>. You
            should check that out, because some of these services are partially open to the public!</p>
            </main>
            <Footer />
        </div>
        <script is:inline defer src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
    </body>
</html>
